## Rich Documentation (premium-docs)

When asked to produce reports, guides, PRDs, runbooks, or technical documents:
- Consult `skills/premium-docs/SKILL.md`.
- Author in Markdown with rich container blocks (`:::tldr`, `:::stats`, `:::card-grid`, `:::badge`, `:::timeline`, `:::callout`, `:::steps`, `:::table-wrap`, `:::tabs`).
- Compile:
  `python skills/premium-docs/scripts/build_doc.py <input.md> -o <output.html>`
- Validate:
  `python skills/premium-docs/scripts/validate_doc.py <output.html>`
<!-- END PREMIUM-DOCS -->
